{
  "name": "Content & Writing",
  "description": "Templates and shortcuts for content creators, bloggers, and writers",
  "author": "Fountain Team",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "category": "Writing",
  "icon": "✍️",
  "macros": [
    {
      "shortcut": "/h1",
      "expansion": "# {cursor}",
      "tags": ["markdown", "heading"]
    },
    {
      "shortcut": "/h2",
      "expansion": "## {cursor}",
      "tags": ["markdown", "heading"]
    },
    {
      "shortcut": "/h3",
      "expansion": "### {cursor}",
      "tags": ["markdown", "heading"]
    },
    {
      "shortcut": "/bold",
      "expansion": "**{cursor}**",
      "tags": ["markdown", "formatting"]
    },
    {
      "shortcut": "/italic",
      "expansion": "*{cursor}*",
      "tags": ["markdown", "formatting"]
    },
    {
      "shortcut": "/link",
      "expansion": "[{input:Link Text}]({input:URL})",
      "tags": ["markdown", "link"]
    },
    {
      "shortcut": "/img",
      "expansion": "![{input:Alt Text}]({input:Image URL})",
      "tags": ["markdown", "image"]
    },
    {
      "shortcut": "/code",
      "expansion": "```{input:language}\n{cursor}\n```",
      "tags": ["markdown", "code"]
    },
    {
      "shortcut": "/quote",
      "expansion": "> {cursor}",
      "tags": ["markdown", "quote"]
    },
    {
      "shortcut": "/list",
      "expansion": "- {cursor}\n- \n- ",
      "tags": ["markdown", "list"]
    },
    {
      "shortcut": "/numlist",
      "expansion": "1. {cursor}\n2. \n3. ",
      "tags": ["markdown", "list"]
    },
    {
      "shortcut": "/table",
      "expansion": "| Column 1 | Column 2 | Column 3 |\n|----------|----------|----------|\n| {cursor} |          |          |",
      "tags": ["markdown", "table"]
    },
    {
      "shortcut": "/blogpost",
      "expansion": "# {input:Title}\n\n*Published: {date:MMMM DD, YYYY}*\n\n## Introduction\n\n{cursor}\n\n## Main Points\n\n### Point 1\n\n### Point 2\n\n### Point 3\n\n## Conclusion\n\n---\n\n*Tags: *",
      "tags": ["blog", "template"]
    },
    {
      "shortcut": "/tldr",
      "expansion": "**TL;DR:** {cursor}",
      "tags": ["summary"]
    },
    {
      "shortcut": "/cta",
      "expansion": "**Ready to get started?** [Click here to {input:Action}]({input:URL})",
      "tags": ["marketing", "cta"]
    },
    {
      "shortcut": "/bio",
      "expansion": "{input:Name} is a {input:Title} at {input:Company}. With {input:Years} years of experience in {input:Field}, they specialize in {input:Specialty}. Connect with them on [LinkedIn]({input:LinkedIn URL}) or [Twitter]({input:Twitter URL}).",
      "tags": ["bio", "about"]
    },
    {
      "shortcut": "/tweet",
      "expansion": "{cursor}\n\n#",
      "tags": ["social", "twitter"]
    },
    {
      "shortcut": "/linkedin",
      "expansion": "{cursor}\n\n---\n\n👉 Follow me for more insights on {input:Topic}\n\n#",
      "tags": ["social", "linkedin"]
    },
    {
      "shortcut": "/headline",
      "expansion": "{input:Number} {input:Adjective} Ways to {input:Action} {input:Topic}",
      "tags": ["headline", "blog"]
    },
    {
      "shortcut": "/disclaimer",
      "expansion": "*Disclaimer: {cursor}*",
      "tags": ["legal"]
    },
    {
      "shortcut": "/note",
      "expansion": "> 📝 **Note:** {cursor}",
      "tags": ["markdown", "callout"]
    },
    {
      "shortcut": "/warning",
      "expansion": "> ⚠️ **Warning:** {cursor}",
      "tags": ["markdown", "callout"]
    },
    {
      "shortcut": "/tip",
      "expansion": "> 💡 **Tip:** {cursor}",
      "tags": ["markdown", "callout"]
    },
    {
      "shortcut": "/lorem",
      "expansion": "Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris.",
      "tags": ["placeholder"]
    }
  ]
}

